"Hallo {{borrower_name}},\n"
"\n"
"das Equipment zu {{rental_number}} wurde ausgegeben.\n"
"\n"
"Rückgabe bis: {{date_to}}\n"
"\n"
"Positionen:\n"
"{{items}}\n"
"\n"
"Viele Grüße\n"
"{{site_name}}"

#. translators: Email subject. Keep the {{rental_number}} placeholder unchanged.
#: includes/Email/Notifications.php:88
